# Plugins LabFlow

## Estrutura obrigatória

```
src/plugins/<id>/
  manifest.ts    # PluginManifest (id, nav, settingsSchema, requires, aiTools)
  actions.ts     # "use server" — lógica de negócio
  page.tsx       # Server component
  api.ts         # handlers REST (opcional)
src/components/<id>/   # client components
src/app/(app)/<rota>/page.tsx  # reexport do plugin page
```

## Registro

1. Import manifest + api em `src/plugins/index.ts` → `BUILTIN_PLUGINS` + `API_REGISTRATIONS`
2. Ícone Lucide em `src/plugins/nav-icons.tsx`

## Manifest

```typescript
export const myManifest: PluginManifest = {
  id: "my-plugin",           // usado na API /api/v1/my-plugin
  name: "Meu Plugin",
  version: "1.0.0",
  requires: ["projects"],    // opcional
  nav: { label, href, icon, order, group },
  apiPrefix: "/api/v1/my-plugin",
};
```

## Actions pattern

```typescript
"use server";
import { requirePermission } from "@/lib/rbac";
import { emit } from "@/lib/events";

export async function createThing(input: ...) {
  const user = await requirePermission("modulo:create", input.projectId);
  // prisma mutation
  await emit({ type: "thing.created", actorId: user.id, projectId, payload: { id } });
  revalidatePath("/rota");
}
```

## API handlers

Chave: `"METHOD path"` ou `"METHOD path/:param"` (barra inicial opcional; registry normaliza). Exemplo: `"GET reports"`, `"POST items"`, `"PATCH items/:id"`.

Auth da API: Bearer `lf_...` / JWT apenas. Preferir chamar server actions via `runApiAction` (usuario injetado por `runWithApiUser`).

Catalogo: `GET /api/v1`. Referência: `src/plugins/board/api.ts`, `src/plugins/knowledge/api.ts`.
